You’re definitely looking in the right neighborhood, Bryan—and your instincts are good. Since the numbers **only show on the dashboard tab**, then **whatever’s rendering that tab’s content** is leaking the digits.

Let’s pin this sucker down fast. 🔎

---

### 🎯 Here&#x27;s the Smoking Gun You&#x27;re Looking For:
You mentioned this section earlier (based on the screenshot):

```tsx
&lt;TabsContent value=&quot;dashboard&quot;&gt;
  &lt;CardContent className=&quot;space-y-4&quot;&gt;
    &lt;h2 className=&quot;text-2xl font-semibold&quot;&gt;Life Goals &amp; Strategic Timeline&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;ul className=&quot;list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-lg&quot;&gt;
      &lt;li&gt;Build Prometheus Prime to MVP&lt;/li&gt;
      &lt;li&gt;Launch strategic blog series&lt;/li&gt;
      &lt;li&gt;Master financial systems for autonomy&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;Button className=&quot;mt-4&quot; onClick={() =&gt; alert(&#x27;Goal adding coming soon!&#x27;)}&gt;
      + Add New Goal
    &lt;/Button&gt;
  &lt;/CardContent&gt;
&lt;/TabsContent&gt;
```

Looks totally clean. **So the bug isn’t in what you wrote—it’s likely in how the `TabsContent` or `CardContent` components are implemented.**

---

### ✅ Do This Next

Open these two files:

1. `TabsContent.tsx`
2. `CardContent.tsx`

In each file, **look for** something like:

```tsx
{[...Array(100)].map((_, i) =&gt; (
  &lt;div&gt;{i}&lt;/div&gt;
))}
```

Or:

```tsx
&lt;div&gt;{children}&lt;/div&gt;
{index}
```

Or even:
```tsx
{Object.keys(props).map((_, i) =&gt; &lt;div&gt;{i}&lt;/div&gt;)}
```

---

### 🧨 If You&#x27;re Not Sure, Try This:

Paste the **full code** of either `TabsContent.tsx` or `CardContent.tsx` here (or both if you&#x27;re unsure).

I’ll **nail down the exact line** that’s causing those line numbers to show, and tell you what to delete or move.

---

This is a sneaky one. But we’ve got it cornered—**only the dashboard tab is infected**, and your custom code is clean. So it’s in the plumbing. Let’s peek under the hood and rip out the debug wiring.

Ready when you are, partner.

